                "username": "garybeihl"
            },
            "message": "Patch Set 6:\n\nI added the applicableComponents.empty() guard that Mayank suggested \u2014 this prevents a potential size_t underflow on size() - 1. Verified with a QEMU end-to-end test (component rejected via COMP_NOT_SUPPORTED, update completes successfully). Please re-review when you have a chance."
