                        "username": "bradbishop"
                    },
                    "message": "From our (the BMC) point of view, this isn't really an error is it?  We are successfully coping with a legal response as outlined in the protocol spec.  This feels like a debug level trace to me (although pldmd is pretty noisy, so maybe info could work too)."
                },
