                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "I just realized the code silently fails on a decode failure instead of calling         updateManager->updateDeviceCompletion(eid, false);. But am not sure if it needs fix in this PR or a separate PR. You can take a call"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/device_updater.cpp",
                    "line": 477,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "garybeihl",
                        "email": "garybeihl@microsoft.com",
                        "username": "garybeihl"
                    },
                    "message": "Good catch - thank you! - The silent decode-failure is a pre-existing pattern \u2014 the same bug exists in all four response handlers (requestUpdate, passCompTable, updateComponent, activateFirmware). I've submitted a separate fix for all four locations: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/89121"
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/device_updater.cpp",
                    "line": 497,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "```suggestion\n    const auto& compVersion = std::get<ComponentImageInfoPos::CompVersionPos>(comp);\n```\n\nLets avoid magic nos."
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/device_updater.cpp",
                    "line": 497,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "garybeihl",
                        "email": "garybeihl@microsoft.com",
                        "username": "garybeihl"
                    },
                    "message": "Done - thank you!"
                }
