                    },
                    "message": "\"RC\" is widely used for encode/decode return codes throughout this file. I would suggest to use \"RESP_CODE\" or something other than \"RC\" here to avoid ambiguity."
                },
                {
                    "file": "fw-update/device_updater.cpp",
                    "line": 514,
